  "description": "The LedgerDirect payment page: states, countdown, polling, QR code and browser wallets \u2014 framework-free, one implementation for every LedgerDirect plugin",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Alexander Busse | Hardcastle Technologies",
  "homepage": "https://www.ledger-direct.com",
